<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 868 0 R
/E (This graph compares observed damselfish species richness with estimated human population density around the selected reef sites. In RStudio, I combined the species richness results with the site population-density data and used Spearman's rank correlation to examine their relationship. The analysis for all 10 sites gave a correlation coefficient of approximately 0.632 and a p-value of 0.050. The result is borderline and should be interpreted cautiously because Danajon Bank had very few GBIF records.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
